{"src":"en","tgt":"ko","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ko","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7720.660705,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9036.537441,"text":"영화 내셔널 트레져를 보셨다면, 독립선언서 뒷면에 보물 지도가 그려져 있었다고 생각하실지도 모릅니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":9197.466629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9198.922125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9200.191563999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9202.004385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9204.164549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9206.124776999999,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"input","t":13884.151065,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14713.719724999999,"text":"그 핫초코는 벨기에 기준에 부합합니다. 과일 주스는 비싸지만, 시간이 지나면 단맛을 느끼실 수 있을 겁니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":14800.397821999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14802.528946999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14802.994708999999,"samples":9975,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"audio","t":14810.28114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14812.153639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14813.963119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14815.161,"samples":23739,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":22220.930114,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23022.411546,"text":"하지만 그것은 사실이 아닙니다. 문서 뒷면에 무언가 적혀 있기는 하지만, 보물 지도는 아닙니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":23079.087235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23080.095339,"samples":23238,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"audio","t":23111.08168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23112.591734999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":23114.489064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23115.053505,"samples":12873,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":29974.613447,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31208.497248999996,"text":"본인 국가 외의 다른 정부의 조언을 참고하고 싶을 수도 있겠지만, 그들의 조언은 자국민을 위해 설계된 것입니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":31349.649292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31351.297405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31352.992707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":31354.814456999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":31356.615078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":31358.366739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":31358.495967,"samples":3455,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":41296.001646000004,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42250.905319000005,"text":"홍콩섬은 홍콩이라는 지역에 이름을 부여했으며, 많은 관광객이 주요 중심지로 여기는 곳입니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":42389.497614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42394.469292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42399.939022000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42405.167526000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42410.470179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42412.272650000006,"samples":13374,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":49104.357931000006,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50170.51581700001,"text":"고위도 지역이나 산악 도로에서 운전하실 분은 눈, 빙판 또는 결빙의 가능성을 고려해야 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":50297.04177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":50302.249825000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50307.857643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50313.067267000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50318.556387000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50319.691288,"samples":9195,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":59093.284456,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59948.191961000004,"text":"분리와 재조합은 두 풀 사이에서 변이를 앞뒤로 섞어 놓습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":60051.711921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":60053.675409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60055.914012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60056.665530000006,"samples":15102,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":61184.222048,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61365.171477,"text":"세대마다."},{"kind":"audio","t":61393.527192,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":950},{"kind":"input","t":66512.542489,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67529.603682,"text":"곤충학자들은 이 곤충 집단을 공식적인 의미에서 '노린재(bug)'라고 부릅니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":67631.853043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67636.89818999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":67642.110944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67647.31666899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":67647.476856,"samples":2953,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":74699.832943,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75975.233394,"text":"우선, 대부분의 기수들은 굽이 있고 매끄러우며 꽤 좁은 밑창의 승마 부츠를 착용합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":76085.819328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76087.37718299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76089.10967399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76091.044253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76092.19912399999,"samples":22736,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":83918.55884299999,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85249.48798199999,"text":"그 위원회는 10월에 시작된 광범위한 반정부 시위에 대한 마르텔리의 대응책이었습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":85358.892306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85359.940189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85361.53219299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85363.14493699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85363.918194,"samples":21065,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":91355.15067199999,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92209.069962,"text":"소방 구조대는 결국 오후 11시 35분까지 불을 껐습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":92304.147011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":92309.1329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92314.305035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92317.898836,"samples":22346,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":97370.079321,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98595.255956,"text":"대서양 허리케인 시즌의 긴장감을 고조시키는 아열대성 폭풍 제리(Jerry)는,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98696.643952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98702.21774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98707.10199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":98712.48574199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":98712.742497,"samples":2396,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100225.951064,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100581.19211199999,"text":"오늘 대서양에서 형성되었습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":100636.933767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100638.270595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":100638.56717,"samples":3845,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107240.02169899999,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107979.69658599999,"text":"그것은 우리가 자동차와 여러 다른 운송 수단들을 훈련시키게 했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":108080.790876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108082.06546499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108083.60663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108084.419556,"samples":20953,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":116617.06189,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117642.906739,"text":"그곳은 서기 400년경에 시작되어 ~까지 지속된 럭셔리의 중심지로 유명합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":117759.056902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117763.977061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117769.020638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117774.28058199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117777.731795,"samples":21900,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":120886.51798599999,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121392.533658,"text":"서기 1100년경까지."},{"kind":"audio","t":121452.673981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":121454.166736,"samples":13764,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":127070.867873,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127602.429706,"text":"달 표면은 암석과 먼지로 이루어져 있습니다. 달의 겉면은 지각이라고 불립니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":127687.061947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127688.309776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127688.761289,"samples":13040,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":127690.50901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127692.106684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":127692.3692,"samples":3566,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":134215.006503,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135444.861562,"text":"미 육군 공병단은 6인치의 강우량이 이전에 손상된 곳을 뚫고 들어올 수 있다고 추정했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":135569.539695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135570.749825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135572.19727200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135573.630588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":135575.32663000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":135575.605316,"samples":5572,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141735.019842,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142706.90322600002,"text":"특히, 미세 표정을 정확하게 해석함으로써 사람이 거짓말을 하고 있는지 감지할 수 있다고 주장됩니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":142848.29041500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142853.385331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142858.610916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142863.897499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142869.15305300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142873.160867,"samples":25356,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":147236.92239400002,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147941.137863,"text":"시설물에 낙서를 하거나 긁어서 훼손하지 마십시오."},{"kind":"audio","t":148010.507504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148011.73885300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148012.89461400002,"samples":25021,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":154876.97761200002,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156383.41904,"text":"호랑이의 포효는 사자의 우렁찬 포효와는 다르며, 오히려 으르렁거리며 외치는 말들의 문장과 더 비슷합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":156532.240327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156537.166246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156542.173554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156547.41069800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156552.54603300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156557.76197800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156558.704062,"samples":13207,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":161915.789701,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163018.391269,"text":"20세기 연구에 따르면 유전적 변이에는 잠재된 것과 발현된 것의 두 가지 풀이 존재합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":163149.93700900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163154.687001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163160.061763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":163165.09837000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163170.31872500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163171.04473300002,"samples":8080,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"close","t":173205.107847,"code":1005}]}